<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">com-pasco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, pastum, ĕre,
				v. n. and <i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To feed together</i>, <i>feed in
				common</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si compascuus ager est, jus est compascere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Top. 3, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 8, 5, 20</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To feed</i>, <i>pasture</i>, in gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brundisiana (ostrea),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 6, 21, § 61</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Pregn. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>To consume by feeding</i>, <i>to
			eat</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pabulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2</span></i>
			, prooem. § 5; so in <i>pass.</i>,
				<i><span class="en">id.
				ib. 1, 53</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>To drive away</i>, <i>destroy</i> by
			feeding: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">famem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 54, 79, § 169</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
